{"id":"lutte","lemma":"lutte","pos":"noun","rank":1724,"glosses":["struggle, fight, battle","wrestling"],"ipa":"/lyt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e1/Fr-lutte.ogg/Fr-lutte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"luttes"},"formAudio":{"luttes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-luttes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ne lutte pas.","en":"Don't struggle.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"L'entreprise lutte pour sa survie.","en":"The company is struggling for survival.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"company, business"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"survival"}]},{"text":"Ce fut une lutte acharnée.","en":"It was an uphill struggle.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"fierce","l":"acharné"}]},{"text":"Je pense qu'il est temps pour moi de me joindre à la lutte.","en":"I think it's time for me to join the fight.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to join"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[11,13,"a la"]]},{"text":"Les médecins ont fait de grandes avancées dans leur lutte contre le cancer.","en":"Doctors have made great strides in their fight against cancer.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"physician","l":"médecin"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},{"g":"advanced","l":"avancé"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"them"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"cancer"}]}]}